  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added continuous region classification (`carry_boundary.rs`, `carry_boundary_prune.rs`) and adaptive spatial boundary subdivision (`carried_boundary_scan.rs`) in `crates/sim/src/stock_sim/`.\n- Exported `boundary_box_penetration` and `boundary_mesh_penetration`, and wired them into `penetration` and `mesh_penetration` in `crates/app/src/fixture_carried.rs`.\n- Preserved exact `x1, y1` block bounds in `Dexel::block`, cylinder bounds across `air_outside_circle` and `Dexel::translate_origin`, and closed `FixtureMesh` provenance in `Body::on_mesh`.\n- Added generalized axis-aligned mesh queries (`BoxSteel`, `steel_on_axis_line`, `steel_on_line_local`, `collect_tris_in_xy`, `steel_in_axis_box`, `steel_in_axis_box_uv`) in `crates/sim/src/fixture_mesh/`.\n- Added zero-allocation bounds fast paths in `Profile::floor` and routed `fixture_carried::material` through `Body::needs_continuous_column`.\n- Added `crates/app/tests/carried_fixture_side_contact.rs`, `crates/sim/tests/carried_boundary.rs`, updated two unit-grid assertions in `carried_fixture_guards.rs`, and added `docs/decisions/1580-side-face-contact.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nCarried-workholding checks relied on dexel column centres and `between_columns` intersection over four cell corners. `Dexel::block` rounded history bounds to `cell` multiples, `air_outside_circle` cleared `history`, `Body::on_mesh` dropped mesh provenance, and boundary cells sampled only four column centres. Steel extending up to one grid pitch past a side face or step missed column centres and passed.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins (`carried_fixture_side_contact`, 6 tests: `box_block_refuses_sub_pitch_side_face_overlap_at_four_grid_phases`, `cylinder_stock_refuses_sub_pitch_side_face_overlap_and_allows_tangent_contact`, `model_stock_refuses_sub_pitch_side_face_overlap_at_four_grid_phases`, `step_face_refuses_sub_pitch_overlap_and_clears_recessed_jaw`, `side_turned_machined_wall_refuses_sub_pitch_overlap_and_allows_contact`, `flipped_hat_refuses_sub_pitch_jaw_overlap_from_tenth_to_seven_tenths_pitch`): failed `0/6` on unchanged `upstream/main`; pass `6/6` after final edit.\n- Unit suite (`carried_boundary`, 4 tests: `steel_on_axis_line_reads_all_signed_axes_and_rejects_bad_inputs`, `steel_in_axis_box_and_uv_cover_all_axes_and_guards`, `concave_l_model_stock_clears_empty_notch_and_catches_sub_pitch_step`, `arc_cut_side_turn_and_cylinder_classify_and_detect_sub_pitch_overlap`): passes `4/4` after final edit.\n- Mutation probes (run prior to the final `clipped_range` clippy parameter-grouping refactor, restored after each):\n  - Reverted `fixture_carried.rs`: `carried_fixture_side_contact` failed `0/6`; passed `6/6` on restore.\n  - Reverted `carry.rs`: `model_stock_refuses_sub_pitch_side_face_overlap_at_four_grid_phases` failed; passed on restore.\n  - Dropped `h.cylinder` retention in `tiles.rs`: `cylinder_stock_refuses_sub_pitch_side_face_overlap_and_allows_tangent_contact` failed; passed on restore.\n  - Reverted `dexel.rs`: `box_block_refuses_sub_pitch_side_face_overlap_at_four_grid_phases` failed; passed `6/6` on restore.\n- Clippy (`cargo clippy -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`): passed with zero warnings after final edit.\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`): passed `3/3` steps (`sim` 307s, `motion` 10s, `app` 443s, 0 failed) after final Rust edit.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. Zero `.nc` or `.cl` files changed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nOpen or non-watertight stock meshes where `FixtureMesh::build` fails and unbacked raw `Dexel` grids continue to sample on columns. Suites outside the `gate quick` map were not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nChangelog: fix(sim): resolve carried side-face and step fixture contact finer than one grid pitch (#1580)\nFixes #1580\n",
